(x15-rocket-to-hawaii)
*title X-15 research surrogate released from a native booster toward Hawaii
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=7.2921151467e-5 gm=3.986004418e14
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=18.580608 reference-length=3.130296 inertia-x=4948.7355 inertia-y=129114.2666 inertia-z=131825.9024 dry-mass-kg=9000.0
*runtime status target latitude-deg=21.31 longitude-deg=-157.86 altitude-m=0.0 velocity-east-mps=0.0 velocity-north-mps=0.0
*runtime status route mode=great-circle terminal-guidance-mode=propnav propnav-attitude-horizon-s=1.0 start-latitude-deg=34.0 start-longitude-deg=-118.2 duration-s=2400.0 powered-end-s=40.0 terminal-start-s=1800.0 apogee-altitude-m=20000.0 powered-speed-mps=2200.0 glide-speed-mps=1700.0 terminal-speed-mps=900.0 terminal-command-speed-mps=1200.0
*runtime status guidance propnav-gain=1.0 attitude-gain=50000.0 rate-damping=5000.0
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=250000.0 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=3600.0
*runtime status thermal policy=none heat-rate-coefficient=0.002
*runtime status telemetry sample-interval-s=2.0 formats=text,json,sqlite,png
*runtime control throttle vehicle=1 default=1.0 lower=0.0 upper=1.0
*runtime control symmetric-stabilator-deg vehicle=1 default=0.0 lower=-14.9 upper=34.9

*trajectory 1 booster-and-x15 start on 1
  *initial ecic
    x=-2498713.869685 y=-4660081.673312 z=3566608.947764
    xdt=-1146.824856 ydt=400.590391 zdt=971.761333
    qw=0.3624865939 qx=0.0 qy=-0.8616482024 qz=0.3551983172
    wx=0.0 wy=0.0 wz=0.0
    time=0.0 mass=30000.0 propellant_mass=9000.0
  *file x15_rocket_to_hawaii.dat time altitude_m latitude_deg longitude_deg speed_m_s mach mass_kg range_to_target_m _segment
  *segment 1 booster-powered
    *integ dtprnt=2.0 dt=0.25
    *prop thrust=300000.0 mdot=100.0
    *when time>20 goto 2
  *segment 2 booster-coast-to-apogee
    *integ dtprnt=2.0 dt=0.25
    *when time>50 goto 3
  *segment 3 x15-release-and-propnav
    *integ dtprnt=2.0 dt=0.25
    *reset mass=14641.0545 propellant_mass=5641.0545
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *fly propnav=4
    *when time>2400 stop
*end
